# Codex CLI 0.167 (ratatui), default [tui] terminal_title: activity, thread name, project name.
# Not recorded: written from its documentation and source as published, as no output of a real session exists.
# While a turn runs the title starts with a braille frame (⠋⠙⠹⠸⠼⠴⠦⠧⠇⠏, 100 ms each) and the status line
# "• Working (Ns • esc to interrupt)" redraws; while it waits for an approval the screen holds still and only the
# title animates an action-required message on its own timer. The text of that message is a stand-in. Codex runs
# as node with its native binary below it; commands run as their children.
